ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCHC2y203u0Q7kNvwHIzNRZ&_nc_oc=AdmnZdJOs25NgSRvbBYlPIxi6kc99geZpd61nK7Dq8rnGGKnUL4kG8_95QpZVfUEhF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft0KcLDeOst0zFgPbFVLKJ2DdlaTulIrdwpN5-bxya20Q&oe=69A5A19C"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4fvkwZdvIoQQ7kNvwELJKgg&_nc_oc=AdmEVviu42TKb5ycZAp0IUajK-YQ15B1aHc7qFxtWEzJ_SVv2-NRO_gWEJRpbgc6P7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuJSMPRYAWhXa1K0TXMeN4HXiLEgO-51pZngSoKEVDNSA&oe=69A59C9C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RPaO2Dzov7wQ7kNvwH0q3On&_nc_oc=Adnn0aTWejLnFWKvKsuX8DIoRw8QxMMvbFUogQlRRQgGx0S5ILB4w6fX7DnSKsVSVqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuvasm7HpX2HGTCLz5Hv4mSwC_WvG3RJg0IIIlyMusyDA&oe=69A57445"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XFb8ghLHzLEQ7kNvwE4rLhH&_nc_oc=AdnuHAFVhfSP